sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Patient/Facility UI
  participant API as Booking API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant OB as Outbox
  participant N as Notification Worker
  UI->>API: POST booking + idempotency key
  API->>API: authorize role + resource scope
  API->>DB: BEGIN transaction
  API->>DB: revalidate affiliation/availability
  API->>DB: enforce global Doctor overlap/capacity
  alt conflict
    DB-->>API: conflict
    API-->>UI: 409 BOOKING_CONFLICT
  else commit
    API->>DB: insert canonical Appointment
    API->>DB: insert OutboxEvent
    API->>DB: COMMIT
    API-->>UI: 201 Appointment
    OB-->>N: committed event
    N-->>UI: notification provider delivery
  end
